  "markdown": "top of page\n\nSkip to Main Content\n\n## CLIENT JOURNEY\n\n![](https://static.wixstatic.com/media/11062b_80ad46a78f624ac8930c53bcf1a01f57f000.jpg/v1/fill/w_1904,h_992,al_c,q_85,usm_0.33_1.00_0.00,enc_avif,quality_auto/11062b_80ad46a78f624ac8930c53bcf1a01f57f000.jpg)\n\n### We take the journey with you.\n\n## PRE-EVENT\n\nProject Management\n\nGeneral Planning\n\nIdentification of Objectives\n\nVenue Selection\n\nFood & Beverage Planning\n\nSpeakers & Entertainment\n\nBudget Development\n\nAir & Ground Travel Management\n\nProgram Registration\n\nDesign, Production & Shipment of Meeting Materials\n\n## ON SITE\n\nAgenda Management\n\nOn-site Registration\n\nHotel & Vendor Management\n\nAudio/Visual Management\n\nFood & Beverage Management\n\nAir & Ground Travel Management\n\nEmergency Preparedness\n\nVIP Management\n\n## POST EVENT\n\nReturn Shipment of Materials\n\nAttendee Expense Reimbursement\n\nCustom Attendee Surveys & Reports\n\nFinal Billing & Reconciliation\n\nROI Analysis\n\n[![REACH logo](https://static.wixstatic.com/media/28cd78_b6659293240c40db888d813137f151bc~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_240,h_100,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Reach%20Logo%20jpg.jpg)](https://www.reachmeetings.com/)\n\nbottom of page",
